00:54:45.701 --> 00:54:48.955
to make decisions based on that?

00:54:48.956 --> 00:54:51.600
So, do you think there
is a inherent tension

00:54:51.601 --> 00:54:53.330
there and sort of there's
a little hump that people need

00:54:53.331 --> 00:54:57.255
to cross to get
comfortable applying

00:54:57.256 --> 00:55:02.340
machine learning for what
critical networking decisions?

00:55:02.341 --> 00:55:04.390
&gt;&gt; So, I mean,

00:55:04.391 --> 00:55:06.120
the examples I talked about,

00:55:06.121 --> 00:55:10.715
they are well-known actual
algorithms that do the job,

00:55:10.716 --> 00:55:15.190
LASSO music and physics guys,

00:55:15.191 --> 00:55:18.465
I was saying there may be some,

00:55:18.466 --> 00:55:20.695
for example in
the networking case,

00:55:20.696 --> 00:55:22.450
the new network
doesn't need to know

00:55:22.451 --> 00:55:25.230
