But I was asking
the question more broadly

00:57:02.101 --> 00:57:04.490
about making
networking decisions.

00:57:04.491 --> 00:57:06.075
&gt;&gt; Yes, I understand.

00:57:06.076 --> 00:57:09.390
&gt;&gt; So, I heard the question
as one of, geez,

00:57:09.391 --> 00:57:10.510
if I have a system
that I don't know

